Skyworth Group Co., Ltd. was founded in 1988, mainly engaged in
multimedia business (smart TV system, COOCAA system Internet value-added
services, etc.), smart system technology business (home access system,
smart manufacturing, automotive Electronic systems and other electronic
products, etc.), smart electrical appliances business (smart air
conditioners, smart refrigerators, smart washing machines, smart
kitchens, etc.), modern service business (home appliance maintenance and
repair, large logistics service industry, foreign trade, construction
and development, financial leasing , Park property management, etc.) and
other four major businesses, the group has two listed companies,
Skyworth Group (HK00751) and Skyworth Digital (000810), several
high-tech enterprises, with a national enterprise technology center, a
national industrial design center, It is the first batch of
demonstration units of "Made in China 2025", and has been among the top
100 Chinese electronics companies for many years.

